    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245790/extras/5581b1782cf7e1001da6eb9a89404b6f.poster.avif?t=1705953563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245790/extras/5581b1782cf7e1001da6eb9a89404b6f.webm?t=1705953563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2245790/extras/5581b1782cf7e1001da6eb9a89404b6f.mp4?t=1705953563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Kendo Warrior is a realistic samurai sword fighting simulator. In the game, the player will take part in exciting duels in medieval Japan. Realistic animations of the most important moves of kendo warriors will introduce the player to the world of this martial art.<br><br>Game highlights:<br>- Sword selection and personalization<br>- Kendo training<br>- Master levels<br>- Challenging opponents<br>- Realistic Japan landscapes<br>- History of Kendo<br>- A gripping samurai story",
